nonallele	From non- + allele.
nonappearance	From Middle English noon apparans, noon apparaunce, noun apperaunce; equivalent to non- + appearance.
nonarbitrable	From non- + arbitrable.
nonarbitrary	From non- + arbitrary.
nonarboreal	From non- + arboreal.
