self-assured	From self- + assured.
self-aware	From self- + aware.
self-awareness	From self- + awareness. Also equivalent to self-aware + -ness, though attested earlier.
self-balancing	From self- + balancing.
self-centered	From self- + centered.
self-centeredness	From self-centered + -ness.
