self-contradiction	From self- + contradiction.
self-contradictory	From self- + contradictory.
self-control	From self- + control.
self-criticism	From self- + criticism.
self-cultivation	From self- + cultivation.
self-deceit	From self- + deceit.
self-deception	From self- + deception.
self-defeating	From self- + defeating (present participle of defeat).
self-defence	From self- + defence.
self-defense	From self- + defense. First used by Hobbes in the 1650s.
self-denial	From self- + denial.
self-denying	From self- + denying.
self-deprecating	From self- + deprecating.
self-depreciation	From self- + depreciation. Commonly used until the 1980s, and is now a minor (although still acceptable) variation of self-deprecation.
self-destruct	From self- + destruct.
self-destruction	From self- + destruction.
self-destructive	From self- + destructive.
self-determination	From self- + determination.
self-directed	From self- + directed.
self-direction	From self- + direction.
self-discipline	From self- + discipline.
self-disciplined	From self- + disciplined.
self-discovery	From self- + discovery.
self-disgust	From self- + disgust.
self-distrust	From self- + distrust.
self-doubt	From self- + doubt.
self-drive	From self- + drive, as a back-formation from self-driving.
