self-made	From self- + made.
self-moving	From self- + moving.
self-opinionated	From self- + opinionated.
self-organization	From self- + organization.
self-pity	From self- + pity.
self-pollinating	From self- + pollinating, from self-pollination.
self-pollination	From self- + pollination.
self-portrait	From self- + portrait.
self-possessed	From self- + possessed.
self-possession	From self- + possession.
self-praise	From self- + praise.
self-preservation	From self- + preservation.
self-pride	From self- + pride.
self-proclaimed	From self- + proclaimed.
self-propelled	From self- + propelled.
self-propelling	From self- + propelling.
self-protection	From self- + protection.
self-realisation	From self- + realisation.
self-realization	From self- + realization.
self-regard	From self- + regard.
self-regulating	From self- + regulating.
self-reliance	From self- + reliance.
