underlay	From Middle English underleyen, from Old English underleċġan ("to underlay, prop, support"), equivalent to under- + lay. Cognate with Dutch onderleggen ("to lay or put under"), German unterlegen ("to underlay"), Swedish underlägga ("to underlay").	From Middle English underlay, underlei, equivalent to under- + lay.
