underwrite	From Middle English underwriten, from Old English underwrītan ("to write at the foot of, write under, subscribe"). Compare Dutch onderschrijven ("to endorse"), German unterschreiben ("to sign; endorse"), Danish underskrive ("to sign; endorse"). By surface analysis, under- + write.
