unkind	Inherited from Middle English unkynde; equivalent to un- + kind.
unkindled	From un- + kindled.
unkindly	From Middle English unkyndely, from Old English unġecyndelīċ; equivalent to un- + kindly (adjective).	From Middle English unkyndely, from Old English unġecyndelīċe; equivalent to un- + kindly (adverb) or unkind + -ly.
unkindness	From Middle English unkyndenesse; equivalent to unkind + -ness.
