unsupportable	From Middle English unsupportable, equivalent to un- + supportable.
unsupported	From Middle English unsupported, equivalent to un- + supported.
unsupportive	From un- + supportive.
unsuppressed	From un- + suppressed.
unsure	From Middle English unsure, equivalent to un- + sure. Piecewise doublet of insecure and unsecure.
unsurmountable	From un- + surmountable.
