untypicality	From untypical + -ity.
ununbium	Systematic element name, from un- + un- + bi- + -ium.
ununderstandably	From ununderstandable + -ly.
ununderstood	From un- + understood.
ununhexium	Systematic element name, from un- + un- + hex- + -ium.
