unusualness	From unusual + -ness.
unutterable	From un- (prefix meaning 'not') + utterable.
unutterably	From unutterable + -ly.
unuttered	From un- + uttered.
unvaccinated	From un- + vaccinated.
unvalued	From un- + valued.
unvanquishable	From un- + vanquishable.
